    <li>Connecticut (CT) - Progressive rates</li>
    <li>Illinois (IL) - Flat rate 4.95%</li>
    <li>Indiana (IN) - Flat rate with county adjustments</li>
    <li>Michigan (MI) - Flat rate with city taxes</li>
    <li>Minnesota (MN) - Progressive rates</li>
    <li>Montana (MT) - Progressive rates</li>
    <li>New Hampshire (NH) - Interest/dividends only</li>
    <li>North Carolina (NC) - Flat rate</li>
    <li>Pennsylvania (PA) - Flat rate 3.07%</li>
  </ul>

